      "message": "https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/blueprint/context.go;l\u003d614-616;drc\u003dmaster\n\nsabiDepsMutator modifies a field in the dependency module, so in order to run in parallel, you should add a Mutex to synchronize the write operation. See overridesLock and addOverride func.\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/override_module.go;l\u003d131;drc\u003dcb6143a142a3a7985d18ad346a6c21314b90cf87\n\nI guess you can add a Mutex to the sabi struct and do the same?",
